cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Search code and computed values for E_1(k) and E_2(k), Erdos Problem #126"
abstract: >-
  Exhaustive and restricted searches for the largest sets of positive
  integers whose pairwise sums have few distinct prime factors, extending
  computations of Wu (2019) and Fueredi (2024). Includes an independent
  second implementation used for cross-verification.
authors:
